{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14048","headline":"和王怀州观西营秋射 · 耿湋","name":"和王怀州观西营秋射","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谢公亲校武，草碧露漫漫。\n落叶停高驾，空林满从官。\n迎筹皆叠鼓，挥箭或移竿。\n名借三军勇，功推百中难。\n主皮山郡晚，饮筭柳营寒。\n明日开铃阁，新诗双玉盘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14048.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14048","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}